{
    "title": "Quiz.AI: AI Math Solver",
    "description": "Quiz.AI is the all-in-one solution to help you conquer your academic challenges effortlessly. \r\n\r\nAs an AI homework helper app, Quiz.AI offers a convenient quick scan feature that effortlessly captures the problems of math, chemistry, biology, physics, etc. and instantly analyzes the content and provides you with the most accurate answers.\r\n\r\nUse Quiz.AI to:\r\n\r\nScan to Solve\r\nOur solver engine is powered by powerful Artificial Intelligence (AI) algorithms, ensuring accurate and efficient problem-solving. Simply scan any math problem, and QuizAI will provide you with step-by-step solutions and explanations. \r\n\r\nCover A Wide Range of Subjects\r\nOur AI homework helper can answer all sorts of questions typically used in tests, including Mathematics, Biology, Physics, Chemistry, Grammar and Vocabulary. This is your go-to study companion and help you ace any tests and quizs.\r\n\r\nStep by Step Explanations\r\nQuiz.AI offers detailed, step-by-step explanations for each problem solved. You'll not only get the right answers but also gain a deeper understanding of the underlying concepts.\r\n\r\nScan and Store Testpaper\r\nUse Quiz.AI to scan test papers and automatically remove handwriting and get a perfectly new, digital one. Select questions from your scans and organize them by subjects. \r\n\r\n\uff5eGet Quiz.AI Premium to Unlock \uff5e\r\nUnlimited Scans to Solve, Unlimited Exports, Scan Test Papers and Convert to Word\u3001More Cloud Storage, etc.\r\n\r\n\uff5eUNLIMITED ACCESS TO MEMBERSHIP SUBSCRIPTION\uff5e\r\n\u2013You can subscribe to get unlimited access to all features of the app.\r\n\u2013Subscriptions are billed monthly or annually at the rate based on the subscription plan.\r\n\u2013Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.\r\n\u2013Subscription renews automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\r\n\u2013Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. The cost depends on the selected plan.\r\n\u2013Subscriptions may be managed by the user, and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.\r\n\u2013Any unused portion of the free trial will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription.\r\n\r\nAbout the terms of service: https://camexam.camscanner.com/protocol\r\nAbout privacy policy: https://camexam.camscanner.com/privacy\r\n\r\n\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6Let us hear your voice\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6\r\nIf you like Quiz.AI, or have any other comments, please take a moment to write us a comment, or send an email to isupport@intsig.com. This will help us continue to improve our products and give you a better experience!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Quiz.AI is the all-in-one solution to help you conquer your academic challenges effortlessly. <br><br>As an AI homework helper app, Quiz.AI offers a convenient quick scan feature that effortlessly captures the problems of math, chemistry, biology, physics, etc. and instantly analyzes the content and provides you with the most accurate answers.<br><br>Use Quiz.AI to:<br><br>Scan to Solve<br>Our solver engine is powered by powerful Artificial Intelligence (AI) algorithms, ensuring accurate and efficient problem-solving. Simply scan any math problem, and QuizAI will provide you with step-by-step solutions and explanations. <br><br>Cover A Wide Range of Subjects<br>Our AI homework helper can answer all sorts of questions typically used in tests, including Mathematics, Biology, Physics, Chemistry, Grammar and Vocabulary. This is your go-to study companion and help you ace any tests and quizs.<br><br>Step by Step Explanations<br>Quiz.AI offers detailed, step-by-step explanations for each problem solved. You&#39;ll not only get the right answers but also gain a deeper understanding of the underlying concepts.<br><br>Scan and Store Testpaper<br>Use Quiz.AI to scan test papers and automatically remove handwriting and get a perfectly new, digital one. Select questions from your scans and organize them by subjects. <br><br>\uff5eGet Quiz.AI Premium to Unlock \uff5e<br>Unlimited Scans to Solve, Unlimited Exports, Scan Test Papers and Convert to Word\u3001More Cloud Storage, etc.<br><br>\uff5eUNLIMITED ACCESS TO MEMBERSHIP SUBSCRIPTION\uff5e<br>\u2013You can subscribe to get unlimited access to all features of the app.<br>\u2013Subscriptions are billed monthly or annually at the rate based on the subscription plan.<br>\u2013Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.<br>\u2013Subscription renews automatically unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.<br>\u2013Account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. The cost depends on the selected plan.<br>\u2013Subscriptions may be managed by the user, and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user\u2019s Account Settings after purchase.<br>\u2013Any unused portion of the free trial will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription.<br><br>About the terms of service: https://camexam.camscanner.com/protocol<br>About privacy policy: https://camexam.camscanner.com/privacy<br><br>\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6Let us hear your voice\u25c6\u25c6\u25c6<br>If you like Quiz.AI, or have any other comments, please take a moment to write us a comment, or send an email to isupport@intsig.com. This will help us continue to improve our products and give you a better experience!",
